Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 12:53:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] localversion: identify experimental build

Add localversion.30-exp so a kernel built from this collection reports a
release ending in -exp, such as 7.2.9-1-cachyos-exp, in uname -r and its
/usr/lib/modules directory. The Arch and CachyOS PKGBUILDs write
localversion.10-pkgrel and localversion.20-pkgname; scripts/setlocalversion
reads localversion* files in name order, so this suffix comes last.

Port to CachyOS 7.3: Build identity only.
---
 localversion.30-exp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 localversion.30-exp

diff --git a/localversion.30-exp b/localversion.30-exp
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..5132f1d11bd7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/localversion.30-exp
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+-exp
